  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The binding energy per nucleon of deuterium and helium nuclei are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math> respectively. When two deuterium nuclei fuse together to form a helium nucleus, the energy released in the fusion is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "0tabF",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
